=== P3/A3/0001 navigation shell — adaptive Navigation-Compose graph matching web/src/App.tsx ===

STEP 1 — Survey of web/src/App.tsx route groups (source of truth).

Two top-level chrome contexts:
  * STANDALONE (rendered OUTSIDE <Layout> — no sidebar/nav chrome):
      quick-stats, glance, year-review/:year, s/:token (shared drive, public),
      watch (API-key auth), onboarding
  * FULL (rendered INSIDE <Layout> — sidebar/header/bottom-tab chrome): everything else,
      including the catch-all 404 (NotFound) which renders with chrome.

Route groups (taxonomy mirrored into NavGroup), canonical pages per group:
  Dashboard        : Dashboard(/), QuickStats(/quick-stats), Glance(/glance), Explore(/explore)
  Vehicles         : Vehicles(/vehicles), VehicleDetail(/vehicles/:id),
                     VehicleAccess(/vehicles/:id/access), DigitalTwin(/digital-twin)
  Charging         : Charging(/charging), ChargeDetail(/charging/:id), ChargingCurve(/charging-curve),
                     ChargingHeatmap(/charging-heatmap), CostAnalysis(/cost-analysis),
                     TeslaChargingHistory(/tesla-charging-history),
                     TeslaChargingSessions(/tesla-charging-sessions), SmartCharge(/smart-charge),
                     Powershare(/powershare)
  Trips & Drives   : Trips(/trips), TripDetail(/trips/:id), Drives(/drives), DriveDetail(/drives/:id),
                     TripReplay(/drives/:id/replay), DriveScore(/drive-score),
                     DrivingDynamics(/driving-dynamics), DrivetrainHealth(/drivetrain-health),
                     Efficiency(/efficiency), SpeedProfile(/speed-profile),
                     RegenEfficiency(/regen-efficiency), RouteEfficiency(/route-efficiency),
                     TripPlanner(/trip-planner)
  Battery & Energy : Energy(/energy), BatteryHealth(/battery), BatteryCells(/battery-cells),
                     BatteryDegradation(/battery-degradation), EnergyFlow(/energy-flow),
                     PowerFlowDashboard(/power-flow), EnergyProducts(/energy-products),
                     VampireDrain(/vampire-drain), ProjectedRange(/projected-range),
                     SleepEfficiency(/sleep-efficiency)
  Analytics & Stats: Analytics(/analytics), Statistics(/statistics), PeriodCompare(/period-compare),
                     Mileage(/mileage), TrueCostOwnership(/tco), WeeklyDigest(/weekly-digest),
                     Timeline(/timeline), FleetCompare(/vehicle-comparison),
                     LifetimeStats(/lifetime-stats), YearReview(/year-review/:year)
  Maps & Location  : LiveMap(/live), Locations(/locations), Geofences(/geofences),
                     NavigationRoute(/navigation), TemperatureImpact(/temperature-impact)
  Vehicle Systems  : ClimateControl(/climate-control), TirePressure(/tire-pressure),
                     Maintenance(/maintenance), SoftwareUpdates(/software-updates),
                     SafetySettings(/safety-settings), GuardMode(/guard-mode), MediaPlayer(/media-player)
  Automations      : Automations(/automations), AutomationList(/automations/list),
                     AutomationBuilder(/automations/new, /automations/:id/edit)
  Notifications    : Inbox(/notifications/inbox), Archived(/notifications/archived),
                     AlertsList(/notifications/alerts), Channels(/notifications/channels),
                     Webhooks(/notifications/webhooks), BrowserNotifications(/notifications/browser),
                     QuietHours(/notifications/quiet-hours), AlertRules(/notifications/rules),
                     AlertStudio(/notifications/studio), NotificationsAudit(/notifications/audit)
  Telemetry/Signals: SignalsWorkspace(/signals), SignalExplorer(/signal-explorer),
                     SignalLogViewer(/signal-log), LiveSignalMonitor(/live-monitor),
                     SignalDiff(/signal-diff), SignalGapDetector(/signal-gaps),
                     MQTTInspector(/mqtt-inspector)
  Diagnostics      : AnomalyDashboard(/anomaly-detection)
  Admin & DevTools : DevTools(/dev-tools), APIKeys(/api-keys), ApiLogs(/api-logs), FleetAPI(/fleet-api),
                     TeslaFeatureFlags(/tesla-features), TeslaRegion(/tesla-region),
                     TeslaOrders(/tesla-orders), GasPriceAutoPoll(/gas-price),
                     SecurityAccess(/security-access), BackupRestore(/backup),
                     ApiPlayground(/api-playground), RedisSignalViewer(/redis-signals),
                     FeedbackQueue(/admin/feedback), FleetTelemetryCoverage(/admin/telemetry/coverage),
                     DLQInspector(/admin/dlq), FeatureFlagsAdmin(/admin/flags),
                     IngestXRay(/admin/ingest-xray), LiveSignalInspector(/admin/live-signals),
                     SchemaDrift(/admin/schema-drift), SlowQueries(/admin/slow-queries),
                     VehicleCost(/admin/vehicle-cost), DiskForecast(/admin/disk-forecast),
                     SecretRotation(/admin/secret-rotation), AuditLog(/admin/audit-log),
                     GDPRExport(/admin/gdpr-exports)
  Power User       : SqlPlayground(/power/sql), GrafanaPanel(/power/grafana), Dashboards(/power/dashboards)
  System & Ops     : SystemStatus(/system-status), IncidentTimeline(/system-status/incidents/:id),
                     StatusApiDocs(/docs/status-api), DataExport(/data-export), Exports(/exports),
                     DataRepair(/data-repair), DBHealth(/db-health), StateMachineDebugger(/state-debugger),
                     Commands(/commands), CommandHistory(/command-history), Chatbot(/chatbot),
                     Roadmap(/roadmap), TeslaAccount(/tesla-account), MyActivity(/me/activity)
  Settings/Account : Settings(/settings), SafetyPage(/settings/safety), TwoFactorAuth(/account/2fa),
                     ActiveSessions(/account/sessions), Privacy(/account/privacy), Helix(/integrations/helix)
  Onboarding       : Onboarding(/onboarding) [standalone]
  Search           : Search(/search)
  Sharing          : SharedDrive(/s/:token) [standalone, public], SharingTrips(/sharing/trips)
  Watch            : WatchFace(/watch) [standalone]
  Not Found        : NotFound(catch-all *)

Alias / redirect paths captured (alias -> canonical):
  /battery/health -> BatteryHealth ; /charging/curves -> ChargingCurve ; /charging/costs -> CostAnalysis
  /charging/schedule -> SmartCharge ; /charging/vampire-drain -> VampireDrain ; /climate -> ClimateControl
  /vehicle-systems/software -> SoftwareUpdates ; /analytics/range -> ProjectedRange
  /analytics/anomalies -> AnomalyDashboard ; /analytics/tco -> TrueCostOwnership
  /compare -> PeriodCompare ; /analytics/compare -> PeriodCompare ; /analytics/lifetime -> LifetimeStats
  /admin -> SystemStatus ; /alerts -> AlertsList ; /alert-studio -> AlertStudio
  /alert-rules -> AlertRules ; /notifications -> Inbox

Primary (bottom-bar) destinations mirror web BottomTabBar (MOBILE_GUIDELINES top-5):
  Dashboard(/), Drives(/drives), Charging(/charging), Battery(/battery), LiveMap(/live)

Decision: NotFound is a real shared screen. A7 page content is OUT OF SCOPE; the foundation
registers full metadata for every route + alias and resolves any route without a registered
A7 page host to the real NotFound screen (no fabricated/placeholder page bodies).

